==Greek==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[miˈte̞ra]|lang=el}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|el}} {{term|μήτηρ||mother|tr=mētēr|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}}, from {{etyl|grk-pro|el}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|el}} {{recons|méh₂tēr|lang=ine-pro}}.

===Noun===
{{el-noun|f|mitéra|μητέρες|m=πατέρας|sort=μητερα}}

# [[mother]]
# something that is the greatest of its kind

====Declension====
